    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d736">

                <pb facs="0919" n="809" xml:id="pg809"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/621: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-24T12:00:00+08:00">April 24,
                        1931—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received April 24—9:25 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Norwegian Minister yesterday effected an exchange of notes with Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs,<anchor n="11" xml:id="d736-f1"/> whereby Norway agrees to give
                    up extraterritorial rights on most-favored-nation basis if and when powers
                    participating in Washington Conference on Pacific affairs relinquish such
                    rights. I understand the Netherlands is negotiating for a similar
                        exchange.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d736-f2"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d736-f1" n="11" xml:id="d736-f1-content">
                <p>League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">cxix</hi>, p.
                    9.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d736-f2" n="12" xml:id="d736-f2-content">
                <p>This exchange was effected also on April 23, 1931 (793.003/624).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
